{"data":[{"author_id":"2092513328191221760","created_at":"2026-11-10T10:43:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120105113088106939"],"id":"2120105113088106939","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Mistral vs Llama 🔵🟣\n\nTwo AI model families worth exploring.\n\nMistral:\n\n- Diverse models\n- Hosted APIs\n- Open-weight releases\n\nLlama:\n\n- Broad open-weight ecosystem\n- Fine-tuning options\n- Community tooling\n\nWhich would you test for your next AI agent?\n\n#AI #LLM #Mistral #Llama https://t.co/DRhZk6FR3H","url":"https://x.com/swapngoel/status/2120105113088106939"},{"article":{"title":"Meet Fable 5.2: The AI That Builds Games and Hardware from Scratch"},"author_id":"2968075642","created_at":"2026-11-10T10:31:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120101972665585954"],"id":"2120101972665585954","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"1-prompt AAA games. Full PCB engineering. 80% on SWE-bench Pro.\n\nClaude Fable 5.2 isn't just an update; it’s a paradigm shift for AI engineering. Read the complete breakdown below. ⬇️ https://t.co/AJzWDEj0D8","url":"https://x.com/un_locked_ai/status/2120101972665585954"},{"author_id":"2031424126192332800","created_at":"2026-11-10T10:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120094116247970160"],"id":"2120094116247970160","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":68,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A Terminal-Bench 2.1 comparison puts GPT-5.6 Sol at 88.8% accuracy, barely ahead of Kimi K3 at 88.3%.\nClaude Opus 4.8 sits at 84.6%.\n\nAn open weight model is almost matching the top score.\n\nAre we reaching the point where the AI model matters less than the agent harness? https://t.co/V3I7qgZsnT","url":"https://x.com/TechWithKavz/status/2120094116247970160"},{"author_id":"2939067599","created_at":"2026-11-10T11:32:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120117420849336339"],"id":"2120117420849336339","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":97,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"$0 PER TOKEN FOR A 750B MODEL. FOR NOW.\nI read up on LG's new EXAONE API: K-EXAONE 2.5 is free for developers as of today, with a 512K context window.\n\nHere's what stands out:\n→ MoE: 750B total, 31B active per token\n→ Price: none listed. Free for now, no end date given\n→ Who: https://t.co/9PZjDXjt0w","url":"https://x.com/raw_logits/status/2120117420849336339"},{"author_id":"2083032260065038336","created_at":"2026-11-10T11:43:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120120046139609510"],"id":"2120120046139609510","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The best ad buyer on X might be a model that grew up in a fake X.\n\n@notmiramurati's team trained Yvligo, an open-weights model, on a replica of X's ad system. In their real $200 test, they say it drove 383 relevant visits to Grok's 123.\n\nSmall teams, go build a simulator.","url":"https://x.com/globalainomad/status/2120120046139609510"},{"author_id":"2051201600098639872","created_at":"2026-11-10T11:19:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120114069260689704"],"id":"2120114069260689704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"💸 As smart as Claude Haiku, at a third of the cost.\n\nMeta just shipped its smallest model: Muse Ember.\n\nAvailable now.\n\n1M-token context.\n\n$0.10 per million input tokens, $0.50 output.\n\nIt scores 36 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index, tied with Claude Haiku 5.5.","url":"https://x.com/max_thinking/status/2120114069260689704"},{"author_id":"2117110124703617024","created_at":"2026-11-10T09:58:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120093840736473394"],"id":"21200938